{'symbol': 'SPG', 'date': '2021-06-21 09:15:00', 'title': 'SIMON PROPERTY GROUP ANNOUNCES 7.7 PERCENT INCREASE IN SECOND QUARTER 2021 DIVIDEND', 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, JUNE 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SIMON, A GLOBAL LEADER IN THE OWNERSHIP OF PREMIER SHOPPING, DINING, ENTERTAINMENT AND MIXED-USE DESTINATIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED A 7.7% INCREASE IN ITS COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND FOR THE SECOND QUARTER 2021.\xa0 SIMON'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A $1.40 PER COMMON SHARE DIVIDEND, PAYABLE IN CASH, FOR THE SECOND QUARTER 2021."}